# Python wiring. defs.bzl exports the py_library, py_test and
# py_binary every package under python/ loads; each is a symbolic macro over
# the rules_py rule of the same name that also declares the ruff, format and
# mypy tests over its own sources. linters.bzl holds the ruff aspect,
# mypy_test.bzl the mypy runner's macro, imports.bzl the shared import root
# and labels.bzl the label helper. This package owns no targets.
